{"name":"MiX Festival Milano 2026","aliases":["MiX Festival 2026","40th MiX Festival"],"city":"milan","date":"2026-09-17","start_date":"2026-09-17","end_date":"2026-09-20","description":"MiX marks its fortieth edition with four days of LGBTQ+ cinema, queer culture, music and masterclasses at Piccolo Teatro Strehler and Casa di Quartiere Garibaldi.","link":"https://mixfestival.eu/","ticket_url":"https://mixfestival.eu/","location":"Piccolo Teatro Strehler and Casa di Quartiere Garibaldi, Milan, Italy","lat":45.4722,"lng":9.1844,"vibe":"landmark Milan queer cinema festival expanding into music, learning and shared culture","intel":{"entry_wait":"Screenings and special appearances have separate capacities; reserve headline films and evening events once the complete ticket grid is published.","best_arrival":"Reach each venue before its listed seating time and allow extra transfer time between the Strehler theatre and Garibaldi community venue.","crowd_mix":"Milan LGBTQ+ communities, filmmakers, cinephiles, students, cultural workers and international visitors gather across four days.","dress_code":"No festival-wide requirement applies; comfortable cinema clothing works by day and a sharper expressive look suits evening events.","host_inclusivity":"MiX explicitly presents itself as a reference festival for the queer community and LGBTQ+ cinema and culture.","source_urls":["https://mixfestival.eu/"],"research_status":"official_dates_venues_and_queer_mission_verified","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:00:00Z"}},
