{"name":"Gender Bender Festival 2026","aliases":["24th Gender Bender Festival"],"city":"bologna","date":"2026-10-29","start_date":"2026-10-29","end_date":"2026-11-07","description":"Gender Bender's twenty-fourth edition brings dance, performance and cultural practices to Bologna, exploring bodies as spaces of connection, transformation and new ways of being together.","link":"https://genderbender.it/en/the-new-edition-of-gender-bender-is-coming-2/","ticket_url":"https://genderbender.it/en/","location":"Multiple cultural venues, Bologna, Italy","lat":44.4949,"lng":11.3426,"vibe":"queer contemporary arts festival using movement to question bodies, identities and belonging","intel":{"entry_wait":"The full venue and ticket grid is released by programme item; reserve small workshops and major performances as soon as booking opens.","best_arrival":"Plan each day from the final venue schedule and arrive before stated start times, leaving room for transfers across central Bologna.","crowd_mix":"Queer communities, dancers, choreographers, artists, students and contemporary-performance audiences meet across the ten-day programme.","dress_code":"No festival-wide code applies; practical clothes suit participatory work, while evening performances welcome polished or expressive styling.","host_inclusivity":"Gender Bender explicitly explores bodies, identity, transformation and new forms of collective life through queer cultural practice.","source_urls":["https://genderbender.it/en/the-new-edition-of-gender-bender-is-coming-2/","https://genderbender.it/en/"],"research_status":"official_2026_dates_artists_and_scope_verified","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:00:00Z"}},
{"name":"Florence Queer Festival 2026","aliases":["FQF26","24th Florence Queer Festival"],"city":"florence","date":"2026-11-18","start_date":"2026-11-18","end_date":"2026-11-22","description":"Florence Queer Festival presents its twenty-fourth edition with LGBTQ+ film, documentary, animation, talks and performance at Cinema La Compagnia.","link":"https://www.florencequeerfestival.it/","ticket_url":"https://www.florencequeerfestival.it/","location":"Cinema La Compagnia, Via Camillo Cavour 50/R, 50121 Florence, Italy","lat":43.7774,"lng":11.2572,"vibe":"Tuscany's principal queer cinema gathering connecting screen culture, memory and activism","intel":{"entry_wait":"Individual screenings use limited cinema seating; reserve premieres, guest sessions and the festival party once the detailed timetable goes live.","best_arrival":"Arrive at Cinema La Compagnia before seating, with extra time for accreditation or ticket collection on opening and weekend evenings.","crowd_mix":"Florence LGBTQ+ communities, international filmmakers, students, activists and arthouse audiences gather around queer screen culture.","dress_code":"There is no appearance requirement; comfortable cinema clothing works throughout, with expressive looks natural at social events.","host_inclusivity":"IREOS created the festival specifically to represent gay, lesbian, bisexual, trans, intersex and changing queer identities.","source_urls":["https://www.florencequeerfestival.it/"],"research_status":"official_primary_source_dates_and_mission_verified","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:00:00Z"}},
